CLI.md §3.5, EVALUATION.md §10.1: --run selects the tests whose name the RE2 expression finds
(search semantics); the others do not run and are not counted.
-- args --
test
--run
overlap
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

test "windows overlap" {
  expect false
}

test "no overlapping windows" {
  expect true
}

test "something else" {
  expect false
}
-- want --
[exit 1]
[stdout]
FAIL  a/a.canon:4  windows overlap
  a/a.canon:5  expect false
  got: false

1 passed, 1 failed (…)
[stderr]
